@rhetoric
title: RHETORIC ----------------------------------------------------------------------
go-to: begin_the_elections


@we_signed_an_armistice
title:  - It was us who actually signed an armistice with Germany—a vote for us is<br>   demonstrably a vote for peace!
choose-if: is_armistice = 1
unavailable_subtitle: We haven't accomplished this yet.
go-to: election_strategy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: peasants_b += 2; workers_b += 5; soldiers_b += 5;

Unlike the other parties who merely talk about peace, we actually took a step in that direction. This fact is emphasized again and again in our newspapers and speeches, helping to supercharge support from those tired of endless war. 

@we_gave_you_land
title:  - We gave the land to the peasants! 
go-to: election_strategy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: peasants_b += 5;

This is a popular slogan to the peasants of the countryside, although there are also signs that the news is slow to reach all corners of the country. It remains to be seen how many peasants have actually heard of our Decree on Land, let alone believe that we should be credited because of it. 

@coalition
title:  - We negotiated an all-socialist government!
go-to: election_strategy
choose-if: coalition_government = 1
unavailable_subtitle: We haven't accomplished this yet.
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: workers_b += 2; soldiers_b += 1; moderate_support += 15; leninist_strength -= 5; leninist_dissent += 5; 

@threaten_revolution 
title:  - There is an element of the struggle between classes at play in these elections <br>   —a third revolution would be necessary should we not win a majority, of course. 
go-to: election_strategy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: leninist_strength += 5; workers_b += 1; workers_b -= 3; left_m_relation -= 5; centre_m_relation -= 3; right_m_relation -= 3; right_m_strength += 3; centre_sr_relation -= 3; right_sr_relation -= 3; right_sr_strength += 3; ns_relation -= 3; k_relation -= 5; k_strength += 2; democraticity -= 2; instability += 2; 

These words cause a public furor, probably hurting more than helping. The bourgeois press runs with the slogan that we are "threatening violence" and further destabilization if we don't get our way, seemingly confirming their worst fears.  


@actions
title: ACTIONS -----------------------------------------------------------------------
go-to: election_strategy


@take_to_the_streets
title:  - Mobilize our activists, give speeches, hold rallies!
go-to: election_strategy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: workers_b += 0.3

Our supporters take to the streets, holding rallies and giving campaign speeches. 

@take_to_the_front
title:  - Send speakers to the frontlines, agitate among the soldiers!
subtitle: -0.5 resources
go-to: election_strategy
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the resources. 
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: soldiers_b += 0.3; resources -= 0.5;

Speakers work there way through the frontlines, spreading our message among those stationed there. 

@print_runs
title:  - Launch a massive run of newspapers, pamphlets, and posters!
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the resources. 
go-to: election_strategy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: workers_b += 0.3; resources -= 0.5;

The party press erupts to life, with our leaders churning out articles and essays. Posters and signs are strung up in the streets. 

@send_to_the_countryside
title:  - Dispatch speakers to the countryside to work among the peasants!
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the resources. 
go-to: election_strategy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: peasants_b += 5; resources -= 1; 

Though an arduous process given the breakdown in the transportation network, our activists work their way through the countryside, reaching new audiences and explaining our policy to the peasants. 

@station_guards
title:  - Station loyal red guards outside the polling places...
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the resources. 
go-to: election_strategy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: workers_b += 10; democraticity -= 3; instability += 2; resources -= 1; 

Stationing red guards outside polling stations opens up a firestorm of accusations that we are intimidating voters and attempting to rig the election. 

